{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The accepted assessment now confirms the local read-response defect.\n\nThe configuration timing concern is explained by a separate publication boundary: `setApplied` updates internal progress, while `GetLastApplied` reads a batch-completion field published only after `ApplyConfigChange` returns. The election guard therefore does not use the earlier internal update.\n\nI also traced snapshot retry ownership. Transport reports status on rejection and transfer completion; delayed delivery releases the snapshot pause, and heartbeat responses resume retry. Shutdown and overlapping-transfer details remain open.\n"}}
